# Article source Markdown.
#
# The published HTML under /invest/ is the single source of truth for article
# copy. There are no separate .md sources to keep in sync, so nothing can drift
# out of step with what is deployed.
#
# This rule stays as a guard. The repo root IS the Cloudflare Pages publish
# root, so any .md committed here would be served at /<slug>.md and would be a
# full duplicate of the published article for Google to index as competing
# content. Verified: /README.md returns 200 with content-type text/markdown.
/*.md
!/README.md
